<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-17T11:01:31.660Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:01:31 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Nigeria recently foiled a terrorist attack in Riyom using drone and CCTV surveillance, while gunmen killed a traditional ruler in Plateau. Gunmen have abducted Catholic priest John Otache in Benue and seized a married couple and their six-month-old daughter in Kaduna, demanding a large ransom. In Plateau, gunmen stormed a mining site killing two people, and in Kaduna a bandit siege forced residents to flee. A nurse died after an asthma attack at a federal hospital amid allegations of emergency care failures. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDc5aGstcVFvYWxpRlczSEVzOUtWWUxOY3hTWGZZTlBPZDRYcV8zMEJEVDM2cGJlUkc3YmNiYkFJdVFhdzNHUVBIOS1rbmkyUjZOTWo2Y2lhUVNJMUxDd0hUNmtTb3A1S3NOdTB0RHJXcGxiRUd4aU5lU3daUkdUeEx5bE42di0wYzJLMndsbVFwVjVTN21HdVZkOHplRi01bkVIN1BrMkJMSFozX250eWtB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Vanguard News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPVENacnZmZk1DQ0ctZHBwVTdiUnFvTzR5cXREUkNQMWREbGQtOHRwTmpJUnNONGFTbEZwaDFqRVljYmw4TUhmSEd2Unk1SXdfdWJhT0ljX0pBdF9kWmZ4UlZuWEdCOWxGYkNuRF9NUUdjTEwyUlZOQkFYeEhhYnRFZ1RIQnFBbDBGd3dvWGhuTjRXWm9LRkVSQW1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;thenewspointer.com.ng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQYWR6VEw2R1JxSEs1Q01zYURaMmswZ3JMakUzMVNNQV84X0wzZUlmVjhNaVNlTmQ0blhLY0hwS1NMN2FqdmoxQ28tcXFMaXFkOUFKTVRrQWhmWFB4YjBNaT